sections:

#### prop_section ####
kind: proposition
----
statement: If an odd number is multiplied by an even number, then the product is even.
----
proof:

Let the odd number *A* multiplied by the even number *B* make *C.*

<figure class="diagram">
<canvas id="canvas_0" width="250" height="130" tabindex="0"></canvas>
<noscript><img alt="IX.28 diagram" src="propIX28.gif"/></noscript>
<script type="text/javascript">
    geomlib.init({
        canvasid: "canvas_0",
